%% Provider live-model flow — feature 037 / 065
%% Brain: 037-anthropic-compatible-providers
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as ProviderCard
    participant Svc as providerService
    participant Rust as Tauri (providers.rs)
    participant Provider as Provider API<br/>(z.ai / MiniMax / Kimi)
    participant Store as settingsStore<br/>(zustand persist)
    participant Chat as ChatSettingsMenu
    participant Env as providerEnvBuilder
    participant App as App.tsx<br/>send_message
    participant Daemon as stream-daemon.js
    participant SDK as claude-agent-sdk<br/>+ claude binary

    Note over User,UI: Phase 1 — Refresh model list
    User->>UI: click "Refresh models"
    UI->>Svc: fetchProviderModels(providerId)
    Svc->>Rust: invoke fetch_provider_models(baseUrl, token)
    Rust->>Provider: GET /v1/models<br/>Authorization: Bearer + x-api-key
    Provider-->>Rust: { data: [{ id, ... }, ...] }
    Rust-->>Svc: { ok, models: [...] }
    Svc->>Store: providerModelCache[id] = { models, fetchedAt }
    Store-->>UI: re-render with model chips

    Note over User,Chat: Phase 2 — Pick a model in chat
    User->>Chat: open ChatSettingsMenu
    Chat->>Store: read providerModelCache[activeId]
    Chat-->>User: Model dropdown shows live list
    User->>Chat: select e.g. "MiniMax-M2.5"
    Chat->>Store: activeProvider.activeModel = "MiniMax-M2.5"
    Chat->>Store: model = "sonnet46"<br/>(forced — must contain "sonnet")

    Note over User,Daemon: Phase 3 — Send a prompt
    User->>App: send message
    App->>Env: getActiveProviderConfig(sessionId)
    Env->>Store: read activeProvider + session override
    Env-->>App: QuackProviderConfig {<br/>  baseUrl, authToken,<br/>  sonnetModel = "MiniMax-M2.5",<br/>  haikuModel = "MiniMax-M2.5",<br/>  defaultModel = "MiniMax-M2.5",<br/>  contextWindow: 1_000_000<br/>}
    App->>Daemon: invoke send_message_via_sdk_streaming<br/>{ ..., model: "sonnet46", providerConfig }
    Daemon->>Daemon: save env originals<br/>(BASE_URL, AUTH_TOKEN, API_KEY,<br/>DEFAULT_SONNET, DEFAULT_HAIKU,<br/>MODEL, OAUTH_TOKEN)
    Daemon->>Daemon: set ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL,<br/>AUTH_TOKEN, DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL,<br/>DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL, MODEL<br/>delete API_KEY + OAUTH_TOKEN
    Daemon->>Daemon: diag log:<br/>PROVIDER_CONFIG_APPLIED:<br/>baseUrl=... sonnetModel=...<br/>oauthCleared=false

    Daemon->>SDK: query({ model: "claude-sonnet-4-6", ... })
    SDK->>SDK: env override:<br/>model contains "sonnet" →<br/>swap to MiniMax-M2.5
    SDK->>Provider: POST /v1/messages<br/>{ model: "MiniMax-M2.5", ... }<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token>
    Provider-->>SDK: stream of events<br/>(echoes "model":"MiniMax-M2.5")
    SDK-->>Daemon: events
    Daemon-->>App: events with usage.model = "MiniMax-M2.5"
    App->>Store: settings.modelDisplayName = "MiniMax-M2.5"
    App-->>User: badge + chip show real model

    Note over Daemon: finally block — restore originals
    Daemon->>Daemon: restore all env vars<br/>(persistent daemon, next query starts clean)
